<subsection xml:id="sec-non-discrimination-statement">
  <title>Non-Discrimination Statement</title>

  <p>
    Midland College does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, sex, disability or age in its programs and activities. The following individual has been designated to handle inquiries regarding the non-discrimination policies: 
  </p>
  <blockquote>
    <p>Title IX Coordinator</p>
    <p>Midland College</p>
    <p>SSC 123</p>
    <p>3600 N. Garfield</p>
    <p>Midland, TX 79705</p>
    <p><email>Title9@midland.edu</email></p>
    <p>(432) 685-4781</p>
  </blockquote>
  <p>
    For further information on notice of non-discrimination, visit the <url href="https://www.ed.gov/about/ed-offices/ocr">Office of Civil Rights website</url>, or call 1 (800) 421-3481.
  </p>
</subsection>

